  "title": "Pernil (Slow-Roasted Pork)",
  "description": "Pernil is a Puerto Rican favorite; pork shoulder with garlic, oregano, and adobe seasoning is roasted until tender and succulent with golden crisp skin.",
  "authors": [
    "Latino0809"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:39:37-04:00",
